0,Songhay languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Songhay_languages,"Roger Blench notes that Songhay shares the defining singulative–plurative morphology typical of Nilo-Saharan languages. As of 2011, he believes that Songhay is closest to the neighboring Saharan languages and is not divergent.","Songhay, Koyraboro Senni",Nilo-Saharan
